memory main heap no
async main no
purpose operation main "Loop that doubles a Float64 var four times: 1.0 -> 2 -> 4 -> 8 -> 16. Exercises a Float64 var modified inside a branchIf-driven loop alongside an i64 counter."
invariant operation main "Uses both float and int math.* primitives in the same operation."
label startMain
storage module immutable oneFloat Float64 1.0
